  "overview": "**Cauldron** is a light-first design system anchored on `#f0f2f5` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (17.5:1 contrast) and `#3c7aae` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `Roboto` (16px display down to 16px body), unified by `3px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **Deque**. Source: published token package, package `@deque/cauldron-styles`. Inventory: **91** colors, **2** typography steps, and **29** documented components (MPL-2.0 license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 29 component tokens with documented paddings: `16px`, `0 8px`, `8px 16px`, `0 16px 0 12px`, `0 16px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#fff` cards; separate sibling sections using `#b3bfc6` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 2px 4px -2px rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.08), 0 4px 8px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04)`, `0 8px 8px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04), 0 20px 24px -4px rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.08)`) paired with `#b3bfc6` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#3c7aae` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#f0f2f5` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#3c7aae` with `#f7f7f8` text (4.3:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `Roboto` headings with `Roboto` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `3px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (3px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#fff` surface shifts and `#b3bfc6` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `3px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
}
